│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ split_rz_layers_add_crz                                                                   │
│ patch_description        │ The second program achieved the best combined score (0.56) with 120 parameters using      │
│                          │ shared RZ layers and a mix of CRZ and CZ gates. The current program has degraded to 72    │
│                          │ parameters with only CZ gates, losing expressivity.                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit implements the recommendation to split the shared RZ layer into two groups:     │
│                          │ - "rz_pre_a" on qubits 0-4 (lower half)                                                   │
│                          │ - "rz_pre_b" on qubits 5-8 (upper half)                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This provides more phase flexibility while maintaining parameter efficiency. I also       │
│                          │ restore parametrized CRZ gates on key pairs to improve entanglement expressivity, and use │
│                          │ a simpler RY structure to keep total parameters around 120.                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The asymmetry in RZ parameters allows the circuit to learn different phase corrections    │
│                          │ for different regions of the qubit space, which should improve both accuracy and          │
│                          │ generalization.                                                                           │
