│ patch_description        │ The current program uses extreme parameter sharing that reduces expressivity. Prior       │
│                          │ program 1 (score 0.56) showed that strategic sharing with CRZ gates performs better. We   │
│                          │ restore a balanced approach:                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
