│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ increase_expressivity_individual_params_threequbit                                        │
│ patch_description        │ Improve expressivity and accuracy by:                                                     │
│                          │ 1. Converting all single-qubit RY gates to have individual parameters (ry_0 through ry_8) │
│                          │ instead of shared ones, enabling per-qubit flexibility                                    │
