│                          │ 2. Adding one CCRZ gate provides controlled three-qubit interactions without excessive    │
│                          │ parameter growth                                                                          │
│                          │ 3. The [1,3,8] triplet connects qubits from different regions of the circuit, potentially │
│                          │ bridging gaps in the entanglement structure                                               │
│                          │ 4. Total parameter increase is minimal (1 new parameter), keeping the circuit efficient   │
