│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ restore_expressivity_add_crx_probe                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ This edit restores the circuit to a configuration closer to the second program (which     │
│                          │ achieved 0.59 score) while incorporating the recommended CRX substitution to probe Y-axis │
│                          │ entanglement.                                                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Key changes:                                                                              │
│                          │ 1. **Revert regional RZ sharing to unified parameters**: The regional sharing             │
│                          │ (rz_pre_a/b, rz_post_a/b) increased parameter count from 114 to 126 without improving     │
│                          │ performance. Unified rz_pre and rz_post reduce parameters back to ~114.                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. **Replace CRZ[1,3] with CRX[1,3]**: Following the expert recommendation, this          │
│                          │ substitution probes complementary Y-axis correlations instead of Z-axis, potentially      │
│                          │ capturing different entanglement patterns without adding gates.                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 3. **Restore three ZZZ gates**: The current program replaced the third ZZZ with CCRZ,     │
│                          │ reducing expressivity. Restoring all three ZZZ gates recovers the expressivity that was   │
│                          │ present in the second program.                                                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 4. **Restore parameter sharing on CRZ gates**: Use crz_shared_0 on [0,2] and [2,4] (as in │
│                          │ the second program) to balance parameter efficiency with expressivity.                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Expected improvements:                                                                    │
│                          │ - Reduced parameter count (from 126 to ~114) should improve generalization                │
│                          │ - CRX substitution tests a new entanglement axis without architectural changes            │
│                          │ - Restored ZZZ gates recover lost expressivity                                            │
│                          │ - Combined effect should improve validation accuracy and reduce the train-test gap        │
