│ patch_description        │ Add a shared mid-layer RZ gate (parameter "rz_mid") on all qubits immediately before the  │
│                          │ ZZZ three-qubit interactions. This provides global phase control right before the most    │
│                          │ expressive circuit components, which can help:                                            │
│                          │ 1. Improve optimization landscape by giving the optimizer a dedicated global phase knob   │
│                          │ 2. Reduce the train-validation gap by enabling finer control during the critical          │
│                          │ three-qubit interaction phase                                                             │
│                          │ 3. Use only 1 additional parameter (shared across all 9 qubits) for better parameter      │
│                          │ efficiency                                                                                │
│                          │ 4. Mirror successful single-parameter phase boosts seen in prior generations              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This lightweight modification should help the circuit learn better without significantly  │
│                          │ increasing complexity.                                                                    │
