│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ restore_zzz_expressivity                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ The current program underperforms compared to prior program 2 (0.57 vs 0.60 score).       │
│                          │ Analysis shows:                                                                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Prior program 2 achieved the best score (0.60) with 114 params by using 2 ZZZ gates    │
│                          │ and no CCRZ gates                                                                         │
│                          │ 2. Current program has only 2 ZZZ gates but also includes 2 CCRZ gates, reducing overall  │
│                          │ performance                                                                               │
│                          │ 3. The current program's validation accuracy (0.56) is significantly lower than prior     │
│                          │ program 2 (0.65)                                                                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The fix: Add back the third ZZZ gate from prior program 1 (which had good expressivity)   │
│                          │ and remove the CCRZ gates (which didn't contribute to the best score). This restores the  │
│                          │ successful expressivity pattern while keeping the efficient parameter sharing structure.  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The shared `rz_mid` layer is already present and beneficial, so we keep it. We're simply  │
│                          │ restoring the ZZZ gate that provides three-qubit correlations without the overhead of     │
│                          │ CCRZ gates.                                                                               │
