│                          │ program's success, it used: (1) more effective three-qubit gate combinations, (2) better  │
│                          │ parameter efficiency, and (3) diverse entanglement patterns.                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit makes three targeted improvements:                                              │
│                          │ 1. Swap CZ[4,8] to CNOT[4,8] to introduce asymmetric coupling (as per recommendation)     │
│                          │ 2. Adjust the ZZZ gate combination from [2,5,8] to [2,6,7] which appeared in the          │
│                          │ better-performing first program                                                           │
│                          │ 3. Add a third ZZZ gate on [1,4,7] to increase three-qubit entanglement expressivity      │
│                          │ without adding too many parameters                                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ These changes maintain the overall circuit depth and structure while improving the        │
