│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ share_zzz_reduce_params                                                                   │
│ patch_description        │ The current program suffers from high overfitting (generalization_gap 0.13 vs 0.07 in the │
│                          │ best program) despite having moderate parameter count. The recommendation suggests        │
│                          │ sharing the two ZZZ gate parameters to test whether uniform three-qubit interactions      │
│                          │ maintain low generalization gap while reducing parameters.                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Additionally, the current program has redundant parameter usage in two-qubit gates        │
│                          │ (cry_shared appears 2x, crx_shared appears 3x but with different semantics). We           │
│                          │ consolidate these and remove the RX layer to reduce complexity, keeping the proven        │
│                          │ RY+RZ+entanglement+three-qubit structure from program 2 which achieved the best           │
│                          │ validation accuracy (0.68) and lowest gap (0.07).                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Changes:                                                                                  │
│                          │ 1. Share zzz_0 and zzz_1 parameters → reduces params by 1, acts as regularizer            │
│                          │ 2. Remove the initial RX layer → reduces 9 params, simplifies circuit                     │
│                          │ 3. Consolidate two-qubit gate parameters for better sharing                               │
│                          │ 4. Keep the proven three-qubit interaction structure                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Expected impact: Lower generalization gap, improved validation accuracy, fewer            │
│                          │ parameters.                                                                               │
