╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ cross                                                                                     │
│ patch_name               │ hybrid_crz_ccrz_crossover                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ This crossover combines the best elements from both high-performing candidates (0.61      │
│                          │ score each):                                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. **From Inspiration Program (0.61)**:                                                   │
│                          │    - Uses CRZ gates with individual parameters (crz_0, crz_2, crz_3, crz_4, crz_6)        │
│                          │ instead of shared parameters                                                              │
│                          │    - Includes CCRZ three-qubit gate for enhanced expressivity                             │
│                          │    - Better validation accuracy (0.68) and lower validation loss (2.05)                   │
│                          │    - More parameters (174) but better generalization                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. **From Current Program (0.58)**:                                                       │
│                          │    - Uses CRX with shared parameter "crx_shared" on pairs (0,2) and (2,4) for parameter   │
│                          │ efficiency                                                                                │
│                          │    - Simpler structure with fewer three-qubit gates (only 2 ZZZ gates)                    │
│                          │    - Lower parameter count (162)                                                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 3. **Crossover Strategy**:                                                                │
│                          │    - Keep the CRZ gates with individual parameters from the inspiration program (better   │
│                          │ expressivity)                                                                             │
│                          │    - Replace CRX shared gates with CRZ individual parameters to match the                 │
│                          │ better-performing pattern                                                                 │
│                          │    - Include the CCRZ gate from the inspiration program for enhanced three-qubit          │
│                          │ interactions                                                                              │
│                          │    - Use the shared RZ phase layer (rz_phase) which appears in both high-scoring variants │
│                          │    - Maintain the final RY output layer for state preparation                             │
│                          │    - This hybrid approach aims to achieve the 0.61+ score by combining proven             │
│                          │ high-performance components                                                               │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The key insight is that individual CRZ parameters outperform shared CRX parameters, and   │
│                          │ including CCRZ gates provides additional expressivity without excessive parameter bloat.  │
