│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ crx_entanglement_with_output_prep                                                         │
│ patch_description        │ The current program is overparameterized (186 params) and overfitting (gap 0.10). Program │
│                          │ 2 achieved better validation accuracy (0.68 vs 0.65) and lower generalization gap (0.07   │
│                          │ vs 0.10) with 174 params.                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The key improvements:                                                                     │
│                          │ 1. Remove the redundant "mirror" three-qubit block (ZZZ and ZZZ gates with shared         │
│                          │ parameters) that adds 3 parameters without improving generalization                       │
│                          │ 2. Replace the fixed CZ on [4,8] with a parametrized CRX gate to introduce X-axis         │
│                          │ entanglement, as recommended                                                              │
│                          │ 3. Keep the proven structure: individual RY encoding, shared RZ phase, mixed CRZ/CRY/CZ   │
│                          │ entanglement, three-qubit interactions, and output RY layer                               │
│                          │ 4. This reduces parameters while adding orthogonal coupling that may improve expressivity │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Expected outcome: Lower parameter count (~177), reduced overfitting gap, improved test    │
│                          │ accuracy by combining the best of Program 2's structure with X-axis entanglement.         │
│ num_applied              │ 2                                                                                         │
